---
title:    "Default Rules for Curry"
citation: "(TPLP 2017)"
url:      "http://doi.org/10.1017/S1471068416000168"
date:     2017-03-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper proposes a new concept of default rules for Curry
that simplifies some computation tasks and is conform with the core properties of Curry.
Default rules are implemented in the
[Curry preprocessor](https://cpm.curry-lang.org/pkgs/currypp.html).
